{
  "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/wordmark.svg#gh-light-mode-only\" width=\"220\" height=\"69\" alt=\"Papilot\"><img src=\"docs/assets/wordmark-dark.svg#gh-dark-mode-only\" width=\"220\" height=\"69\" alt=\"Papilot\"><br>**Next-Generation AI LaTeX Editor**\n\n<h3>Don't&nbsp;read&nbsp;or&nbsp;write&nbsp;<code>.tex</code>&emsp; Just&nbsp;work&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;<img src=\"docs/assets/pdf.svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"24\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"PDF\"></h3>\n\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai\"><b>papilot.ai</b></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://papilot.ai/demo\">Online demo</a>&emsp;<a href=\"#get-started\">Get started</a>&emsp;<a href=\"#agents\">Agents</a>&emsp;<a href=\"#how-it-works\">How it works</a>\n\n<!-- BEGIN BADGES -->\n[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/github/license/PapilotAI/papilot?style=flat&color=22c55e)](LICENSE)\n[![CI](https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/PapilotAI/papilot/ci.yml?branch=main&style=flat&label=CI)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/actions/workflows/ci.yml)\n[![Release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/PapilotAI/papilot?style=flat&label=release&color=0969da)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest)\n[![GitHub total downloads](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/PapilotAI/papilot/total?style=flat&logo=github&label=downloads&color=0969da)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases)\n[![npm monthly downloads](https://img.shields.io/npm/dm/papilot?style=flat&logo=npm&label=downloads&color=cb3837)](https://www.npmjs.com/package/papilot)\n[![GitHub stars](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/PapilotAI/papilot?style=flat&logo=github&label=stars&color=0969da)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/stargazers)\n[![Discord](https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Join%20us-5865F2?style=flat&logo=discord&logoColor=white)](https://discord.gg/WdgZDDAvwj)\n<!-- END BADGES -->\n\n<p data-language-switcher><sub><a href=\"README.md\">English</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.zh-CN.md\">简体中文</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.zh-Hant.md\">繁體中文</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.ja.md\">日本語</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.ko.md\">한국어</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.de.md\">Deutsch</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.fr.md\">Français</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.es.md\">Español</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.pt.md\">Português</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.it.md\">Italiano</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.sv.md\">Svenska</a></sub></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai\">\n<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-compact-dark.png\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-dark.png\">\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-compact.png\">\n  <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero.png\" alt=\"Papilot shows an AI edit as a typeset before-and-after on the PDF, with Accept, Reject and Comment.\" width=\"900\">\n</picture>\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<a id=\"features\"></a>\n\n## Why Papilot\n\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\">\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-annotate-dark.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-annotate.png\" alt=\"A sentence and a figure boxed on the PDF, each with a note for the agent.\" width=\"100%\"></picture><br>\n<b>Point at the page</b><br>\nSelect a sentence, or box an equation or a figure, and write what should change. Your agent gets the exact source lines, whichever file they are in.\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\">\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-review-dark.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-review.png\" alt=\"A change shown typeset, before and after, with Accept, Reject and Comment.\" width=\"100%\"></picture><br>\n<b>Review every change typeset</b><br>\nEach edit comes back as a before-and-after on the PDF. Accept, reject or comment on it; nothing reaches your paper until you accept it.\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\">\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-overleaf-dark.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-overleaf.png\" alt=\"Papilot and Overleaf side by side, synced live both ways, with coauthors' cursors in Overleaf.\" width=\"100%\"></picture><br>\n<b><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/overleaf-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/overleaf.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;Live sync with Overleaf</b><br>\nCoauthors keep writing in Overleaf. Your accepted changes reach them in about a second, and theirs land in your files and PDF with their names on them.\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\">\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-agents-dark.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-agents.png\" alt=\"The model menu below the chat, with models from Codex, Claude and GLM.\" width=\"100%\"></picture><br>\n<b>Any agent, any model</b><br>\nPick a model from any connected agent below the chat. Switch to another agent and Papilot reruns your request with it.\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\">\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-record-dark.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-record.png\" alt=\"Accepted changes committed with a message and pushed, in the version history.\" width=\"100%\"></picture><br>\n<b>Every change on the record</b><br>\nEach task runs in its own Git worktree, away from your files. Committing accepted changes is a separate step, and every change stays in your Git history.\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\">\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-phone-dark.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-phone.png\" alt=\"The same review on a phone, in front of the desktop window.\" width=\"100%\"></picture><br>\n<b>Review from your phone</b><br>\nOpen Papilot on your phone or tablet over <a href=\"docs/guide.md#remote-access-with-tailscale\">Tailscale</a>, then read the PDF, mark it up and accept changes away from your desk.\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-universe-dark.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-universe.png\" alt=\"Papilot Universe: LaTeX templates for theses, journals, conferences, CVs and posters.\" width=\"100%\"></picture><br>\n<b>Start from a template</b><br>\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai/universe/\">Papilot Universe</a> has theses, journal and conference kits, slides, posters, CVs and books, and points more than 400 conferences to the template their call for papers asks for. Choose one and Papilot creates the paper, ready to compile.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n<a id=\"quick-start\"></a>\n<a id=\"get-started\"></a>\n<a id=\"downloads\"></a>\n\n## Get started\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai/#download\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/mac-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/mac-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/mac-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/mac.png\" alt=\"Download for macOS: Apple silicon and Intel, DMG, ZIP or Homebrew.\" width=\"49%\"></picture></a>\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai/#download\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/windows-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/windows-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/windows-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/windows.png\" alt=\"Download for Windows: x64 installer, portable app or Scoop.\" width=\"49%\"></picture></a>\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai/#download\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/linux-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/linux-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/linux-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/linux.png\" alt=\"Download for Linux: AppImage, APT (.deb), AUR or Nix.\" width=\"49%\"></picture></a>\n<a href=\"docs/guide.md#install-and-run\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/terminal-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/terminal-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/terminal-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/terminal.png\" alt=\"Install in a terminal: npm install -g papilot, then papilot demo. Needs Node.js 22.22+.\" width=\"49%\"></picture></a>\n</p>\n\n<details>\n<summary><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/pm-bar-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/pm-bar-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/pm-bar-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/pm-bar.png\" alt=\"Package managers: Homebrew, Scoop, APT, AUR and Nix — show install commands\" width=\"96%\" align=\"absmiddle\"></picture></summary>\n\n<br>\n\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/homebrew-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/homebrew.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;**macOS · [Homebrew](https://github.com/PapilotAI/homebrew-tap)**\n\n```sh\nbrew tap PapilotAI/tap\nbrew trust PapilotAI/tap\nbrew install --cask PapilotAI/tap/papilot\n```\n\n<sub>Unsigned — allow in Privacy &amp; Security on first launch (<a href=\"https://github.com/PapilotAI/homebrew-tap#gatekeeper-note\">details</a>).</sub>\n\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/scoop-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/scoop.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;**Windows · [Scoop](https://github.com/PapilotAI/scoop-bucket)**\n\n```powershell\nscoop bucket add papilot https://github.com/PapilotAI/scoop-bucket\nscoop install papilot/papilot\n```\n\n<sub>Upgrade anytime with <code>scoop update papilot</code>.</sub>\n\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/debian-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/debian.svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/ubuntu-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/ubuntu.svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;**Debian / Ubuntu · [APT](docs/apt.md)**\n\n```sh\ncurl -fsSL https://papilot.ai/apt/gpg.key | sudo gpg --dearmor -o /etc/apt/keyrings/papilot.gpg\necho \"deb [arch=amd64 signed-by=/etc/apt/keyrings/papilot.gpg] https://papilot.ai/apt stable main\" |\n  sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/papilot.list\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install papilot\n```\n\n<sub>Signed repo — verify fingerprint in the <a href=\"docs/apt.md\">APT guide</a>.</sub>\n\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/archlinux-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/archlinux.svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;**Arch Linux · [AUR](docs/aur.md)**\n\n```sh\nparu -S papilot-bin\n```\n\n<sub>Or build with <code>makepkg -si</code> — see the <a href=\"docs/aur.md\">Arch guide</a>.</sub>\n\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/nixos-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/nixos.svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;**Nix · [Flake](docs/nix.md)**\n\n```sh\nnix run github:PapilotAI/papilot -- demo\n```\n\n<sub>See the <a href=\"docs/nix.md\">Nix guide</a> for flakes, profiles and dev shells.</sub>\n\n</details>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><sub>Free and open source. Needs Git, a TeX distribution and a signed-in <a href=\"#agents\">agent</a>.</sub></p>\n\n<a id=\"agents\"></a>\n\n## Works with your agent\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"docs/guide.md#agents\">\n    <picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/grid-compact-dark.png\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/grid-dark.png\">\n      <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/grid-compact.png\">\n      <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/grid.png\" alt=\"Papilot Writer, Codex, Claude, Cursor, GitHub Copilot, Grok, Antigravity, Kimi, GLM, ZCode, DeepSeek, Qwen, OpenCode, Qoder, CodeBuddy, WorkBuddy and Pi\" width=\"848\">\n    </picture>\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><sub>Bring the login or API key you already have, or use the built-in Papilot Writer. <a href=\"docs/guide.md#agents\">Setup</a></sub></p>\n\n<a id=\"how-it-works\"></a>\n\n## How it works\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/flow-compact-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/flow-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/flow-compact.png\">\n    <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/flow.png\" alt=\"1. Open your paper: a folder, an Overleaf project or a template. 2. Mark the PDF. 3. The agent edits a copy in its own Git worktree. 4. See it typeset: the sentence becomes the T-Abs inference rule, drawn on the page. 5. You decide: accept, reject or comment for another round. 6. Commit and sync: changes land in your files and Git history, and sync to Overleaf if linked.\" width=\"1000\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n<a id=\"documentation-and-community\"></a>\n\n## Community\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/issues/new/choose\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/issue-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/issue-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/issue-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-community/issue.png\" alt=\"Report a bug: open an issue, even a rough one.\" width=\"49%\"></picture></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/discussions\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/discussion-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/discussion-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/discussion-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-community/discussion.png\" alt=\"Ask a question or share an idea in Discussions.\" width=\"49%\"></picture></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/WdgZDDAvwj\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/discord-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/discord-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/discord-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-community/discord.png\" alt=\"Chat on Discord with the people who build and use Papilot.\" width=\"49%\"></picture></a>\n<a href=\".github/CONTRIBUTING.md\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/contribute-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/contribute-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/contribute-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-community/contribute.png\" alt=\"Contribute: pull requests are welcome, including ones written with AI agents.\" width=\"49%\"></picture></a>\n</p>\n\nPapilot ships often: see the [changelog](CHANGELOG.md).\n\n## Contributors\n\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/graphs/contributors\">\n    <picture>\n      <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://papilot.ai/readme-contributors/compact.svg\">\n      <img src=\"https://papilot.ai/readme-contributors/desktop.svg\" alt=\"Papilot's contributors\">\n    </picture>\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n## Star History\n\nIf Papilot saves you time, a star helps other researchers find it.\n\n<a href=\"https://www.star-history.com/?repos=papilotai%2Fpapilot&type=date&legend=bottom-right\">\n <picture>\n   <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://api.star-history.com/chart?repos=papilotai/papilot&type=date&theme=dark&legend=bottom-right\" />\n   <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://api.star-history.com/chart?repos=papilotai/papilot&type=date&legend=bottom-right\" />\n   <img alt=\"Star History Chart\" src=\"https://api.star-history.com/chart?repos=papilotai/papilot&type=date&legend=bottom-right\" />\n </picture>\n</a>\n\n---\n\n<p align=\"center\"><sub><a href=\"LICENSE\">MIT</a> © 2026 PapilotAI. Thanks to our friends at <a href=\"https://linux.do/\">LINUX DO</a>.</sub></p>\n": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/wordmark.svg#gh-light-mode-only\" width=\"220\" height=\"69\" alt=\"Papilot\"><img src=\"docs/assets/wordmark-dark.svg#gh-dark-mode-only\" width=\"220\" height=\"69\" alt=\"Papilot\"><br>**新一代 AI LaTeX 编辑器**\n\n<h3>无需读写&nbsp;<code>.tex</code>&emsp; 直接在&nbsp;<img src=\"docs/assets/pdf.svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"24\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"PDF\">&nbsp;上修改</h3>\n\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai\"><b>papilot.ai</b></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://papilot.ai/demo\">在线演示</a>&emsp;<a href=\"#get-started\">快速上手</a>&emsp;<a href=\"#agents\">智能体</a>&emsp;<a href=\"#how-it-works\">工作原理</a>\n\n<!-- BEGIN BADGES -->\n[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/github/license/PapilotAI/papilot?style=flat&color=22c55e)](LICENSE)\n[![CI](https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/PapilotAI/papilot/ci.yml?branch=main&style=flat&label=CI)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/actions/workflows/ci.yml)\n[![Release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/PapilotAI/papilot?style=flat&label=release&color=0969da)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest)\n[![GitHub total downloads](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/PapilotAI/papilot/total?style=flat&logo=github&label=downloads&color=0969da)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases)\n[![npm monthly downloads](https://img.shields.io/npm/dm/papilot?style=flat&logo=npm&label=downloads&color=cb3837)](https://www.npmjs.com/package/papilot)\n[![GitHub stars](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/PapilotAI/papilot?style=flat&logo=github&label=stars&color=0969da)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/stargazers)\n[![Discord](https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Join%20us-5865F2?style=flat&logo=discord&logoColor=white)](https://discord.gg/WdgZDDAvwj)\n<!-- END BADGES -->\n\n<p data-language-switcher><sub><a href=\"README.md\">English</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.zh-CN.md\">简体中文</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.zh-Hant.md\">繁體中文</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.ja.md\">日本語</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.ko.md\">한국어</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.de.md\">Deutsch</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.fr.md\">Français</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.es.md\">Español</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.pt.md\">Português</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.it.md\">Italiano</a>&emsp;<a href=\"docs/readme/README.sv.md\">Svenska</a></sub></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai\">\n<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-compact-dark.png\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-dark.png\">\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-compact.png\">\n  <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero.png\" alt=\"Papilot 在 PDF 上以排版后的前后对比形式展示 AI 修改，并提供接受、拒绝和评论按钮。\" width=\"900\">\n</picture>\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<a id=\"features\"></a>\n\n## 为什么选择 Papilot\n\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\">\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-annotate-dark.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-annotate.png\" alt=\"PDF 上框选了一句话和一张图，分别附有发给智能体的批注。\" width=\"100%\"></picture><br>\n<b>在页面上直接指点</b><br>\n划选句子，或框选公式与图表，写下修改要求。无论源码在哪个文件中，智能体都能准确定位到对应的源码行。\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\">\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-review-dark.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-review.png\" alt=\"以排版效果展示修改前后的对比，带有接受、拒绝和评论选项。\" width=\"100%\"></picture><br>\n<b>以排版效果审阅每处修改</b><br>\n每次修改都会在 PDF 上呈现排版后的前后对比。你可以接受、拒绝或发表评论；在点击接受前，任何改动都不会写入你的论文。\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\">\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-overleaf-dark.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-overleaf.png\" alt=\"Papilot 与 Overleaf 并排显示，双向实时同步，Overleaf 中可见合作者的光标。\" width=\"100%\"></picture><br>\n<b><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/overleaf-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/overleaf.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;与 Overleaf 实时同步</b><br>\n合作者可以继续在 Overleaf 中写作。你接受的修改约一秒即可同步给他们，而他们的改动也会署着各自的名字实时更新到你的文件和 PDF 中。\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\">\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-agents-dark.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-agents.png\" alt=\"聊天框下方的模型菜单，包含来自 Codex、Claude 和 GLM 的模型。\" width=\"100%\"></picture><br>\n<b>任意智能体，任意模型</b><br>\n在聊天框下方从已连接的任意智能体中选择模型。切换到其他智能体时，Papilot 会使用新智能体重新运行你的请求。\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\">\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-record-dark.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-record.png\" alt=\"版本历史中，已接受的修改附带提交说明完成提交并推送。\" width=\"100%\"></picture><br>\n<b>每处改动皆有记录</b><br>\n每个任务都在各自独立的 Git 工作树中运行，不会直接触碰你的文件。提交已接受的修改是独立的一步，每次改动都会保存在你的 Git 历史中。\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\">\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-phone-dark.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-phone.png\" alt=\"手机上显示着与桌面窗口相同的审阅界面。\" width=\"100%\"></picture><br>\n<b>在手机上审阅</b><br>\n通过 <a href=\"docs/guide.md#remote-access-with-tailscale\">Tailscale</a> 在手机或平板上打开 Papilot，即使不在桌前，也能阅读 PDF、添加标记并接受修改。\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-universe-dark.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/why-universe.png\" alt=\"Papilot Universe：适用于学位论文、期刊、会议、简历和海报的 LaTeX 模板。\" width=\"100%\"></picture><br>\n<b>从模板开始</b><br>\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai/universe/\">Papilot Universe</a> 汇集了学位论文、期刊与会议套件、幻灯片、海报、简历和书籍模板，并为 400 多个学术会议匹配了征稿通知所要求的模板。任选其一，Papilot 即可创建可直接编译的论文。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n<a id=\"quick-start\"></a>\n<a id=\"get-started\"></a>\n<a id=\"downloads\"></a>\n\n## 快速上手\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai/#download\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/mac-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/mac-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/mac-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/mac.png\" alt=\"下载 macOS 版：支持 Apple 芯片和 Intel，提供 DMG、ZIP 或 Homebrew。\" width=\"49%\"></picture></a>\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai/#download\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/windows-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/windows-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/windows-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/windows.png\" alt=\"下载 Windows 版：提供 x64 安装程序、便携版应用或 Scoop。\" width=\"49%\"></picture></a>\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai/#download\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/linux-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/linux-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/linux-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/linux.png\" alt=\"下载 Linux 版：提供 AppImage、APT（.deb）、AUR 或 Nix。\" width=\"49%\"></picture></a>\n<a href=\"docs/guide.md#install-and-run\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/terminal-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/terminal-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/terminal-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/terminal.png\" alt=\"在终端中安装：运行 npm install -g papilot，然后运行 papilot demo。需要 Node.js 22.22+。\" width=\"49%\"></picture></a>\n</p>\n\n<details>\n<summary><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/pm-bar-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/pm-bar-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/pm-bar-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-downloads/pm-bar.png\" alt=\"包管理器安装：Homebrew、Scoop、APT、AUR 和 Nix — 展开查看命令\" width=\"96%\" align=\"absmiddle\"></picture></summary>\n\n<br>\n\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/homebrew-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/homebrew.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;**macOS · [Homebrew](https://github.com/PapilotAI/homebrew-tap)**\n\n```sh\nbrew tap PapilotAI/tap\nbrew trust PapilotAI/tap\nbrew install --cask PapilotAI/tap/papilot\n```\n\n<sub>未签名 — 首次启动请在「隐私与安全性」中允许（<a href=\"https://github.com/PapilotAI/homebrew-tap#gatekeeper-note\">详情</a>）。</sub>\n\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/scoop-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/scoop.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;**Windows · [Scoop](https://github.com/PapilotAI/scoop-bucket)**\n\n```powershell\nscoop bucket add papilot https://github.com/PapilotAI/scoop-bucket\nscoop install papilot/papilot\n```\n\n<sub>随时运行 <code>scoop update papilot</code> 升级。</sub>\n\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/debian-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/debian.svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/ubuntu-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/ubuntu.svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;**Debian / Ubuntu · [APT](docs/apt.md)**\n\n```sh\ncurl -fsSL https://papilot.ai/apt/gpg.key | sudo gpg --dearmor -o /etc/apt/keyrings/papilot.gpg\necho \"deb [arch=amd64 signed-by=/etc/apt/keyrings/papilot.gpg] https://papilot.ai/apt stable main\" |\n  sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/papilot.list\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install papilot\n```\n\n<sub>签名软件源 — 指纹校验见 <a href=\"docs/apt.md\">APT 指南</a>。</sub>\n\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/archlinux-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/archlinux.svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;**Arch Linux · [AUR](docs/aur.md)**\n\n```sh\nparu -S papilot-bin\n```\n\n<sub>也可使用 <code>makepkg -si</code> 构建 — 见 <a href=\"docs/aur.md\">Arch 指南</a>。</sub>\n\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/nixos-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/nixos.svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;**Nix · [Flake](docs/nix.md)**\n\n```sh\nnix run github:PapilotAI/papilot -- demo\n```\n\n<sub>Flake、Profile 与开发环境见 <a href=\"docs/nix.md\">Nix 指南</a>。</sub>\n\n</details>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><sub>免费且开源。需要 Git、TeX 发行版以及已登录的<a href=\"#agents\">智能体</a>。</sub></p>\n\n<a id=\"agents\"></a>\n\n## 支持你常用的智能体\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"docs/guide.md#agents\">\n    <picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/grid-compact-dark.png\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/grid-dark.png\">\n      <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/grid-compact.png\">\n      <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/grid.png\" alt=\"Papilot Writer、Codex、Claude、Cursor、GitHub Copilot、Grok、Antigravity、Kimi、GLM、ZCode、DeepSeek、Qwen、OpenCode、Qoder、CodeBuddy、WorkBuddy 和 Pi\" width=\"848\">\n    </picture>\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><sub>可直接使用你现有的账号登录或 API 密钥，也可使用内置的 Papilot Writer。<a href=\"docs/guide.md#agents\">配置指南</a></sub></p>\n\n<a id=\"how-it-works\"></a>\n\n## 工作原理\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/flow-compact-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/flow-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/flow-compact.png\">\n    <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/flow.png\" alt=\"1. 打开你的论文：本地文件夹、Overleaf 项目或模板。2. 在 PDF 上标记。3. 智能体在独立的 Git 工作树中编辑副本。4. 查看排版效果：文字描述转化为直接呈现在页面上的 T-Abs 推导规则。5. 由你决定：接受、拒绝，或发表评论以进行下一轮修改。6. 提交并同步：修改写入本地文件与 Git 历史，若已关联 Overleaf 则同步至 Overleaf。\" width=\"1000\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n<a id=\"documentation-and-community\"></a>\n\n## 社区\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/issues/new/choose\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/issue-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/issue-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/issue-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-community/issue.png\" alt=\"反馈问题：提交 Issue，哪怕只是初步描述。\" width=\"49%\"></picture></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/discussions\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/discussion-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/discussion-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/discussion-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-community/discussion.png\" alt=\"在 Discussions 中提问或分享想法。\" width=\"49%\"></picture></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/WdgZDDAvwj\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/discord-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/discord-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/discord-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-community/discord.png\" alt=\"在 Discord 上与 Papilot 的开发者和用户交流。\" width=\"49%\"></picture></a>\n<a href=\".github/CONTRIBUTING.md\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/contribute-compact-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/contribute-dark.png\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-community/contribute-compact.png\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-community/contribute.png\" alt=\"参与贡献：欢迎提交 Pull Request，包括借助 AI 智能体编写的贡献。\" width=\"49%\"></picture></a>\n</p>\n\nPapilot 更新频繁：请查看[更新日志](CHANGELOG.md)。\n\n## 贡献者\n\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/graphs/contributors\">\n    <picture>\n      <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://papilot.ai/readme-contributors/compact.svg\">\n      <img src=\"https://papilot.ai/readme-contributors/desktop.svg\" alt=\"Papilot 的贡献者\">\n    </picture>\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n## Star 历史\n\n如果 Papilot 为你节省了时间，欢迎点亮一颗 Star，帮助更多研究者发现它。\n\n<a href=\"https://www.star-history.com/?repos=papilotai%2Fpapilot&type=date&legend=bottom-right\">\n <picture>\n   <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://api.star-history.com/chart?repos=papilotai/papilot&type=date&theme=dark&legend=bottom-right\" />\n   <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://api.star-history.com/chart?repos=papilotai/papilot&type=date&legend=bottom-right\" />\n   <img alt=\"Star 历史趋势图\" src=\"https://api.star-history.com/chart?repos=papilotai/papilot&type=date&legend=bottom-right\" />\n </picture>\n</a>\n\n---\n\n<p align=\"center\"><sub><a href=\"LICENSE\">MIT</a> © 2026 PapilotAI. 感谢 <a href=\"https://linux.do/\">LINUX DO</a> 社区伙伴们的支持。</sub></p>\n"
